## Discontinued Integrations

- **PLYR** — this L1 has been discontinued. Never mention PLYR or sPLYR anywhere on the site or in copy.

## What to Avoid

- Do not lead with token/airdrop content — that is secondary to the core protocol value
- Do not make Suzaku the hero — the builder is the hero, Suzaku is the guide
- Do not use generic DeFi landing page tropes ("unlock liquidity", "earn yield")
- Do not use any font other than Inconsolata
- Do not use pure black (`#000000`) — use Deep Black (`#101010`) instead
